WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:14.304
Hi! I'm Mac the apple tree.

2
00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:17.654
I like spring because it's warm.

3
00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:23.095
I have new flowers and leaves.

4
00:00:23.096 --> 00:00:25.123
The bees visit me.

5
00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:30.918
Ahhh! Spring.

6
00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:33.992
I like summer because it's hot.

7
00:00:33.993 --> 00:00:36.415
My apples are big.

8
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:41.829
My leaves are green.

9
00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:44.236
People have picnics.

10
00:00:44.237 --> 00:00:50.706
Hmmm! Summer.

11
00:00:50.707 --> 00:00:54.071
I like autumn because it's cool.

12
00:00:54.072 --> 00:00:56.424
My apples are red.

13
00:00:56.425 --> 00:01:01.857
My leaves are colorful.

14
00:01:01.858 --> 00:01:04.088
People pick apples.

15
00:01:04.089 --> 00:01:11.561
Wow! Autumn.

16
00:01:11.562 --> 00:01:14.936
I like winter because it's cold.

17
00:01:14.937 --> 00:01:17.225
My apples fall off.

18
00:01:17.226 --> 00:01:23.267
My leaves fall off.

19
00:01:23.268 --> 00:01:26.159
People make snowmen.

20
00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:31.569
Brrr! Winter.
